{"id":"wb-6-103","name":"御窑厂窑址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"御窑厂","text":"御窑厂，明代及清初称御器厂，位于今江西省景德镇市珠山区，明洪武二年（1369年）设，是明清两代专门制作皇家用瓷的官窑，御窑厂前后延续四百多年，是中国延续时间最长、规模最大、品类最多、工艺最精的官窑。御窑厂窑址于2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BE%A1%E7%AA%91%E5%8E%82","revisionId":93886157,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93886157","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/70ed07293f7645c750f8ab8e.jpg","title":"御窑厂（2012年摄）--CNJX-798-002.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BE%A1%E7%AA%91%E5%8E%82%EF%BC%882012%E5%B9%B4%E6%91%84%EF%BC%89--CNJX-798-002.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/%E5%BE%A1%E7%AA%91%E5%8E%82%EF%BC%882012%E5%B9%B4%E6%91%84%EF%BC%89--CNJX-798-002.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"TAOZIlovewiki","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNJX-798-002","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}